      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay so it's not like they have a plan or something. but if there's no signal and no pre-set plan, how does the second particle \"know\" what to do the exact moment the first one is measured? it seems almost like there's some invisible thing or something sneaky happening behind the scenes.",
      "source": "evaluator"
